Hi,

Minutes from today's Open Printing monthly teleconference are posted at:

 ftp://ftp.pwg.org/pub/pwg/fsg/minutes/OP-Minutes-20100914.htm

Actions:

    - ACTION - Mihara-san, Toratani-san - new Stable OPVP/1.0 draft in
September

    - ACTION - OP Steering Committee - approve OPVP/1.0 in September

    - ACTION - CPD development team
      - Complete patches for adding CPD to the desktops by March 2011

    - ACTION - Printer manufacturers
      - Identify resources to update PPDs and do integration testing in
        February/March 2011 and through late summer 2011

    - ACTION - All OP members
      - Identify applications/desktops that will evaluate CPD in March
        through late summer 2011

    - ACTION - CPD development team
      - Target CPD release for fall 2011 editions of Linux distributions

Next OP teleconferences:

(1) October 2010 - US/Europe - Monthly OP Meeting
    - Tuesday 5 October 2010, Daytime
      - US
        9am in San Francisco - US PDT (Pacific Daylight Time)
        10am in Colorado - US MDT (Mountain Daylight Time)
        11am in Chicago - US CDT (Central Daylight Time)
        12pm in New York - US EDT (Eastern Daylight Time)
      - Europe
        6pm in Berlin - CEST (Central European Summer Time)

    * Main Number (Till Kamppeter, LF, leader)
      International: +1-218-936-7999
      Access Code:   491659#

(2) November 2010 - US/Europe - Monthly OP Meeting (tentative)
    - Note - European Summer Time ends on Sunday 31 October 2010
    - Note - US Daylight Time ends on Sunday 7 November 2010

    - Tuesday 2 November 2010, Daytime
      - US
        9am in San Francisco - US PDT (Pacific Daylight Time)
        10am in Colorado - US MDT (Mountain Daylight Time)
        11am in Chicago - US CDT (Central Daylight Time)
        12pm in New York - US EDT (Eastern Daylight Time)
      - Europe
        5pm in Berlin - CET (Central European Time)

    * Main Number (Till Kamppeter, LF, leader)
      International: +1-218-936-7999
      Access Code:   491659#

